sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant E as Endpoint
    participant S as Server
    U->>E: Question admitted
    Note over E: due = admission time<br/>+ 4 s
    E->>S: Question
    S-->>E: Answer and proof, or no answer
    Note over E: Check proof.<br/>Keep due fixed.
    Note over E: Wake 5 ms early.<br/>Spin until due.
    alt Valid answer checked by due
        E-->>U: Proven output
    else Not checked in time, or invalid
        E-->>U: unavailable
    end
    Note over U,E: Never before due.<br/>OS and network may<br/>delay arrival.
